ttps://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-merge-queue%5Bbot%5D/received_events", "type": "Bot", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "jobs_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/actions/runs/36901540741/jobs", "logs_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/actions/runs/36901540741/logs", "check_suite_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/check-suites/99952805754", "artifacts_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/actions/runs/36901540741/artifacts", "cancel_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/actions/runs/36901540741/cancel", "rerun_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/actions/runs/36901540741/rerun", "previous_attempt_url": null, "workflow_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/actions/workflows/176126070", "head_commit": {"id": "5f7f4ce67bd063efdbadf9acacd4bf711f51f0c0", "tree_id": "e12ae972d122c14754dd9db0f63efa4bdfece117", "message": "Add inspector details panel (#25885)\n\n# Objective\n\nPart of #23013.\n\nShow the selected entity's components in the inspector, rendered from\nreflection with feathers widgets.\n\n# Solution\n\nA details panel next to the tree, in a resizable split pane in the\nexample, read only for now.\n\n- one collapsible group per component with its short name and memory\nsize\n- fields rendered by kind, checkboxes for bools, number inputs for\nnumbers, text inputs for strings, a swatch for colours, a select for\nunit enums, nested rows for structs, lists, maps and sets\n- a draggable column splitter between field names and values in each\ncomponent\n- rebuilds only the components that change and updates values in place\notherwise, keyed by `ComponentId` and field path so editing can write\nback through the same paths\n- scrolls inside its pane with a feathers scrollbar\n\nSingle field tuple structs collapse into their inner value and nesting\nstops at four levels.\n\n# AI disclosure\n\nLike the rest of the series, I scoped this piece myself and had AI\nhandle the mechanical port from Jackdaw plus a first pass for errors,\nthen reviewed and ran it locally. Running it is what surfaced most of\nthe changes here. Despawning a disabled feathers number input panicked,\nwhich is fixed separately in #25859. Without the `debug` feature every\ncomponent name showed a placeholder, so headers now come from the\nreflect registry. Opaque values flickered on every refresh because two\nrows shared the same key, and long values ran past the edge of the\npanel.\n\n# Showcase\n<img width=\"944\" height=\"1020\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d32a9e9-eb97-433c-a450-ed09a7bedc37\"\n/>\n\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/815ee36b-c1b2-464b-95a5-c89c75a02d2e\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Alice Cecile <alice.i.cecile@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Federico Rinaldi <gisquerin@gmail.com>", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T17:02:46Z", "author": {"name": "Joe Buehler", "email": "jbuehler23@gmail.com"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com"}}, "repository": {"id": 234798675, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyMzQ3OTg2NzU=", "name": "bevy", "full_name": "bevyengine/bevy", "private": false, "owner": {"login": "bevyengine", "id": 60047606, "node_id": "MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjYwMDQ3NjA2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60047606?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/bevyengine", "html_url": "https://github.com/bevyengine", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bevyengine/fol